==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/'fɹiːləʊdə(ɹ)/}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# One who does not [[contribute]] or [[pay]] appropriately; one who gets a free ride, etc. without paying a fair share.
# {{UK|NZ|Canada|Scotland}} An individual who gets merchandise from the back of supermarket premises that is past its sell-by date.

====Synonyms====
* [[free rider]]
* [[mooch]], [[moocher]]

